WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.200
SiteLog — synthetic demonstration.

00:02.200 --> 00:12.000
The tradesperson sees a simple entry form fixed to the current working week.

00:12.000 --> 00:25.000
They select the project and location, describe the work and enter its value.

00:25.000 --> 00:38.000
The new entry appears alongside the other records in the weekly summary.

00:38.000 --> 00:53.200
A complete weekly invoice is generated for download and processing.

00:53.200 --> 00:54.900
Admin view.

00:54.900 --> 01:06.000
The administrator exports the selected week as a structured spreadsheet.

01:06.000 --> 01:15.000
Live projects can be added, viewed and archived from one screen.

01:15.000 --> 01:31.400
Users, business units and trade details are maintained through straightforward controls.
